    "body": "Installed the repaired audit workflow. F7 selects and teleports to the next uncorrected location; F5 goes to the previous location. The navigator no longer draws a separate blue marker or owns F10. While it is loaded, F2 now moves only the navigator's selected normal map blip and saves X, Y, and Z; holding F2 restores all three coordinates. The smaller navigator text uses the same style as the camera/movement text and sits below the top readout. Both ASIs were hash-verified in the game folder. Test after the next launch.",
